# check takes off what it made. Then three wooden bodies go in: one thrown
# right at 5 m/s onto the sand on the left ledge, one turned 45° and
# thrown down at 10 m/s onto the floor, and one thrown up and left at
# 8 and 12 m/s against the stone square. A square brush digs a hole in
# the square, and creative mode pours water over the floor's body.
